  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Merged Districts (KPMD) Support Programme (previously called the Federally Administered Tribal Areas (FATA) Development Programme) - Programme design costs is a component of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Merged Districts (KPMD) Support Programme (previously called the Federally Administered Tribal Areas (FATA) Development Programme) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;192,941. It works in the following sector(s): Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution, Basic health care, Primary education, Legal and judicial development, Public sector policy and administrative management, Public finance management (PFM).</narrative>
  </description>
